]🤖 FAQ Chatbot using NLP

An intelligent and interactive FAQ Chatbot built using Python, Natural Language Processing (NLP), NLTK, TF-IDF, Cosine Similarity and Streamlit.

The chatbot understands a user's question and finds the most relevant answer from a predefined collection of Frequently Asked Questions.

---

📌 Project Overview

The goal of this project is to create a simple NLP-based chatbot that can automatically answer frequently asked questions.

Instead of using a large language model or paid API, this project uses TF-IDF and Cosine Similarity to compare the user's question with stored FAQ questions.

How it works

User Question
      ↓
Text Preprocessing
      ↓
Tokenization / Cleaning
      ↓
Lemmatization
      ↓
TF-IDF Vectorization
      ↓
Cosine Similarity
      ↓
Best Matching FAQ
      ↓
Chatbot Response

