🧠 NLP Techniques

1. Text Cleaning

The chatbot converts text to lowercase and removes unnecessary characters.

2. Stopword Removal

Common English words that provide little information are removed using NLTK.

3. Lemmatization

Words are converted into their base form.

For example:

running → run
questions → question

4. TF-IDF

TF-IDF converts FAQ questions into numerical vectors based on the importance of words.

5. Cosine Similarity

Cosine similarity compares the user's question with all stored FAQ questions and identifies the closest match.

